# ViRent

Portfolio-quality mixed-fleet rental platform (Viredsoft brand) — passenger cars, vans, wagons, and work machinery in a single system.

## Stack
- Laravel 13 + Filament v5 (admin panel)
- Vue 3 + TypeScript + Inertia 3
- shadcn-vue + Tailwind v4 (CSS variable theming)
- Laravel Reverb (real-time booking hold)
- barryvdh/laravel-dompdf (contract/invoice PDF)
- stripe/stripe-php (deposit payment)
- filament/spatie-laravel-media-library-plugin (fleet images)
- photoswipe (frontend gallery lightbox)

## Architecture principles
- Categories use dynamic attributes (EAV-style), no hardcoded "type" enum — see database.mdc
- Pricing logic lives exclusively in `PricingService` — see database.mdc
- Booking conflicts are prevented via DB lock + buffer time — see database.mdc

Details: see `theming.mdc`, `database.mdc`.